        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 455, Mortise Modern Turnpiece Privacy Bolt For Bedroom and Bathroom Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 455 Privacy Bolt features a modern designed turnpiece and rosette--simple yet timelessly elegant. Mortise privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 9163 Classic Privacy Door Bolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2/14\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height (both interior and exterior): 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width (both interior and exterior): 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 9/16\" throw solid brass bolt</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, and emergency release exterior rose. \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
